 # Obsidian Vault
 
-**Location:** Set via `OBSIDIAN_VAULT_PATH` environment variable (e.g. in `~/.hermes/.env`).
+Read, create, and manage Markdown notes in the user's Obsidian vault.
 
-If unset, defaults to `~/Documents/Obsidian Vault`.
+**Vault location:** `OBSIDIAN_VAULT_PATH` env var (set in `~/.hermes/.env`).
+Falls back to `~/Documents/Obsidian Vault` if unset.
 
-Note: Vault paths may contain spaces - always quote them.
+> Always quote vault paths — they commonly contain spaces.
 
